Description:

The DAV:principal-property-search and DAV:principal-search-property-set
REPORTs are now also accepted on calendar and addressbook collections and
their home sets.  With DAV:apply-to-principal-collection-set they search
the principals, as RFC 3744 describes; without it they find nothing.


